      "fontSize": 30.83333333333336,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Workflow \n\n1. Web pages will be implemented in html and styled with CSS. \nPython flask OR JavaScript will be used to integrate logic and call APIs as necessary \n\n2. Back end services will be hosted on AWS. \n    - User sign in will be done via cognito\n    - Actions the user can take that like create, edit, delete etc data will\n        be handled via API gateway\n    - API Gateway will point to lambda functions (when necessary) that will\n        complete these tasks\n    - Data will be stored in the DB. Structure TBD",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Workflow \n\n1. Web pages will be implemented in html and styled with CSS. \nPython flask OR JavaScript will be used to integrate logic and call APIs as necessary \n\n2. Back end services will be hosted on AWS. \n    - User sign in will be done via cognito\n    - Actions the user can take that like create, edit, delete etc data will\n        be handled via API gateway\n    - API Gateway will point to lambda functions (when necessary) that will\n        complete these tasks\n    - Data will be stored in the DB. Structure TBD",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
